# Wheel-installable core of the Stage-2 RL environment.
#
# Miles, SGLang, the reference `nla` package and this project are NOT here: all
# four are installed editable from patched git checkouts by
# scripts/setup_rl_stack.sh. This file pins the parts pip can resolve, so the env
# is reproducible from a manifest instead of from whatever resolved that day.
#
# torch is deliberately unpinned here and installed FIRST from the cu124 index by
# the setup script. Pinning it in this file would fight that.
sglang[all]>=0.5.6
transformers
accelerate
ray
pyarrow
numpy
safetensors
httpx
orjson
pyyaml
